PatchCardDetails.description:
The mutable subset of a card's details. Only the fields present are updated;
physical attributes (card_type, last_four, is_virtual) and expiry_date are
immutable and cannot be changed through this endpoint.

secret.description:
The active signing secrets for this webhook. Returned only in create and rotate responses;
omitted on retrieve and list. At most two secrets are active at once, which happens during a
24-hour rotation grace period.
